Third-party notices

CST Studio Suite is a product of Dassault Systemes. This program is an
independent tool that drives a locally installed copy through its documented
Python result library and VBA macro interface. No CST component is included in
or distributed with this program; the CST Python libraries are loaded at run
time from the user's own installation.

The "sb_sadea" proposal method implements the algorithm described in
Liu et al., "An Efficient Method for Antenna Design Based on a Self-Adaptive
Bayesian Neural Network Assisted Global Optimization Technique", IEEE
Transactions on Antennas and Propagation, 2022, DOI 10.1109/TAP.2022.3211732.
Please cite that paper if you publish results obtained with it. This
implementation is not a complete reproduction; the differences are documented in
docs/USAGE.md and docs/使用说明.md.

Dependencies (installed separately, not distributed with this program):
numpy, scipy, scikit-learn, joblib, threadpoolctl (all BSD-3-Clause) and,
optionally, PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause).
